{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24829","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 杨嗣复","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上玉郎骑白鹤，肘後金壶盛妙药。\n暂游下界傲五侯，重看当时旧城郭。\n羽衣茸茸轻似雪，云上双童持绦节。\n王母亲缝紫锦囊，令向怀中藏秘诀。\n令威子晋皆俦侣，东岳同寻太真女。\n搜奇缀韵和阳春，文章不是人间语。\n药成自固黄金骨，天地齐兮身不没。\n日月宫中便是家，下视崑仑何突兀。\n童姿玉貌谁方比，玄发绿髯光弥弥。\n满朝将相门弟子，随师尽愿抛尘滓。\n九转琅玕必有余，愿乞刀圭救生死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨嗣复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}